          "displayText": "At the conference, sporting the theme of “Interconnection, Integration, Inheritance, Innovation,” delegates （代表） found themselves closely connected to the Global Civilization Initiative (GCI), which advocates respect for the diversity of civilizations, the common values of humanity, the importance of inheritance and innovation of civilizations.",
